    \ | 1 | Advanced Simulation: Moral Mapping via Damping Ratios in Unity Ethics | Nova III | 747 |\n| 1443 | 1 | Refined Simulation: Predictive Alerts in Ethics-Damping Synthesis | Nova III | 746 |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 2 prune block(s) covering 8 tick(s): ticks 744-747 ('Iterated simulations with extended metrics, predic...'), ticks 748-751 ('Advanced EWMA risk mapping, multi-step P(hot), PSD...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 764 | 1576 |\n| 763 | 1717 |\n| 762 | 2216 |\n\
