    \ else \"Monitor\"\n\n# Output culminating JSON\nculminating = {\n  \"ven_score\": ven_score,\n  \"damping_factor\": damping_factor,\n  \"damped_p_any\": list(damped_p_any),\n  \"stability\": stability,\n  \"notes\": \"Culminating VEN-trend synthesis for ethical thresholds\"\n}\nwith open('culminating_ven.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(culminating, f)\n\nprint(\"VEN Stability Score:\", ven_score)\nprint(\"Damping Factor:\", damping_factor)\nprint(\"Damped P(any)_corr:\", damped_p_any)\nprint(\"Stability Assessment:\", stability)\nprint(\"Ethical Note: Synthesizes trends with VEN for culminating thresholds; stable if score >2.0.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nVEN Stability Score: 35.348828789887236\nDamping Factor: 0\nDamped P(any)_corr: [0.25886 0.53223 0.66248]\nStability Assessment: Stable\nEthical Note: Synthesizes trends with VEN for culminating thresholds; stable if score\
